{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51301","headline":"贞元六年春三月庚子百寮宴於曲江亭上赋诗以赐之 · 李适","name":"贞元六年春三月庚子百寮宴於曲江亭上赋诗以赐之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁闰节华晚，衆芳繁暮春。\n霁日天地晴，元巳风景新。\n禊饮传旧俗，古今欢此辰。\n至乐在同和，丝竹奚所陈。\n薰琴是赏心，姑射可凝神。\n何必尚躭缅，浮觞曲水滨？\n（《太平御览》五九二《文部·御制》引《唐书》。\n）（今按：两《唐书》本纪均不载，《全唐诗》另有一首不同。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}